WEBVTT

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.940
Do you feel better now?

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.320
I do! Thank you!

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.690
Mikono!

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.070
Mikono's on the tower!

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:17.480
Mikono!

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.250
Calling all Elements.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.200
Abductors have been detected in the Neo-Kowloon area.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.750
Training is suspended.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:32.820
<i>Cayenne, Zessica, and Andy, please
return to the Academy immediately.</i>

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.260
I'll take care of it for you, my friend.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.180
Head back to the Academy.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.140
You too, Sazanka.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.940
But Mikono is in danger!

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:48.020
Do you think your sister is more
important than your duty as an Element?

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.140
Hey, wait for me!

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:59.260
You go well together.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:05.250
Your Union will be the greatest and most beautiful of all.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:09.500
If only I could give it to you.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:49.390
Found you.

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:58.030
You stink.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.780
What a delicious stench.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.450
Mikono!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.200
This is...

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.500
It's not love.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.500
This is...

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.590
a forbidden meeting.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.280
Mikono!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:34.900
What a delicate little thing.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.820
Let her go!

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.690
Where's your smell?

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:49.620
You don't have one. You don't smell at all.

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.870
Why the hell don't you have a smell?

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.290
Hey.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.680
Mind if I kill you?

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:03.930
I'd really prefer you didn't...

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.060
Huh.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.060
Wait!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.780
Stay out of my way.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:16.310
This is my wench.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:28.740
No...

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.120
I won't let you...

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.260
I won't let you have Mikono!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.130
Asshole!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.240
His wings!

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:16.620
What the hell's that noise?

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.100
Kagura has gone to Vega again.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.040
Who opened the gate for him?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.440
Kagura's Gnis was supposed to be locked out.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.640
It's been a long time, Izumo.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.950
You've grown up, Jin.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.180
Mikage!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.290
I had a feeling you were behind this.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.500
When did you awaken?

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:00.120
When?

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:03.340
I was awakened by a kiss...

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.960
from the Machine Angel's forbidden power.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:10.020
Why did you help Kagura?

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:12.470
I merely saw him off.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:18.660
The chosen one, blazing a trail into a new world of love.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.230
"New world of love"?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.820
The Machine Angel unleashed its forbidden powers.

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:29.910
And thus, the Rare Igura within it is guiding Kagura.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:36.080
Aren't you a little curious about the Rare Igura he follows so doggedly?

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:44.590
And one that can keep a leash on the Machine Angel, at that.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:49.780
She may be the true Eve for us of Altair.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.460
Continue the reconnaissance of Vega.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:02.670
If another irregularity occurs, take back the Mithra Gnis by force.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:03.700
Yes, sir.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.700
Alicia...

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:57.800
Hey, mind if I kill you?

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.660
Sure.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.960
If you can play me.

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:16.100
Your smell is really faint.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.160
And you kinda smell like her.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:26.900
Damn it!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.760
You would make a lovely sound.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:46.290
Shrade stayed in Neo-Kowloon, didn't he?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.800
Fine.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:52.120
Deploy as soon as Cayenne, Zessica, and Andy return.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.220
Roger.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:58.680
Um... I've been wondering this for a while.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.970
Why hasn't Shrade ever been deployed?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:10.340
He always gets the best results in mock battles.

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:13.480
So the girls have been curious as to why...

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.940
Boys and girls Unite together now,

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:20.660
so we should know about other Elements we might have to do it with.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:33.800
Shrade Elan had a great gift with music from a young age.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:42.840
But a strong, dark Element power infused the music from his piano.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:02.120
They said his music could reach into
people's minds and play on their pain.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:07.040
So the rumors spread, and eventually, he became a terrible weapon.

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:38.120
This sound!

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.440
Neo-Deava?

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:06.180
So Shrade got pulled in by the chairman kid?

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:09.040
Wait, how old is the chairman, anyway?

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:16.140
But the Element aptitude test revealed something terrible.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:21.860
Piloting Aquarion would shorten Shrade's life.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:27.800
Aquarion amplifies the power within its Elements.

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:33.000
That power feeds back into the Elements, each strengthening the other.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.590
Shrade's Element power is too strong.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:42.100
His sick body can't handle channeling Aquarion's power.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.600
I'm so sorry.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.160
It was a little damaged.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:53.480
But it has a lovely sound.

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:59.420
I would die happy hearing its voice.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.330
Mikono!

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.380
I'm sorry...

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:25.800
I have to tell him I'm sorry...

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.960
You're sorry? Him?

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.260
What are you talking about, Mikono?

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:33.600
The Abductor alarm!

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:38.940
Vectors!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:49.260
Goddamn it! Why can't anyone leave us alone?

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.960
My wench...

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.000
Where is she?!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:21.940
It's him!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:26.200
It's that beastial Abductor again!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.040
Mithra Gnis.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.790
Is that the name of the robot, High Commander?

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:42.580
I can smell better from in here.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.010
Cayenne!

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:56.770
Not this one.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.650
Must be that one!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:07.280
Look out, Zessica!

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:20.920
I can tell...

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.040
He's looking for Mikono.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:28.090
Mikono!

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:29.960
You're awake!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:32.060
Amata...

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.340
Where am I?

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:40.760
Mikono, you were saying that you have to apologize to him.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:42.360
Apologize?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.680
I don't know.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:50.610
I was so scared when he grabbed me.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:56.020
But it felt like he really cared about me.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:59.480
And then, I thought that it felt so familiar...

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.510
I can't shake him!

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.740
Found you.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.990
My wench!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.720
Are you all right, my friend?

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:56.220
Shrade?

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.560
Let me take over.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:06.060
But your body can't take it!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.020
Give me my wench!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.250
Mikono! Why, that...

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:27.220
Don't worry about me! Amata!

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.320
I felt it, too.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:32.380
I think I know him.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:39.220
And I know that I can't let him take you.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:47.620
Cayenne!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.400
That's not him! Wait...

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.610
Shrade!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.610
Why is he in a Vector?

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.370
You can't do this!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.380
Our enemy is not playing with us.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:06.500
You need me for this fight.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.200
But your body...

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.130
Fudo...

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.920
Element Change!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.130
Call back Andy W. Hol!

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:18.680
What? But I was finally about to Unite with a girl!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.300
Get over here, wench!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:30.770
What are you doing?

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.320
Vector Z!

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:37.080
Mikono, get out of here.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.490
Amata!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.880
Chairman Crea, requesting permission for Union.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.050
Shrade! You can't!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.020
I'm ready to die.

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:04.470
If I can't play Aquarion, I may as well be dead.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:25.080
Union authorized!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.080
Shrade Elan, you're the head!

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:34.130
I've been waiting for this.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:38.880
For when I could finally play Aquarion!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.560
Melodic Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:58.900
A powerful sound is resonating inside my chest!

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.530
But why does it feel so comfortable?

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.300
This is the sound of life itself!

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.370
The first sound we made when we came out of the womb!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.000
Aquarion Spada!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.360
A Union with Vector Y as the head!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:21.050
Aquarion Spada!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:29.390
Shrade's power has given Aquarion a new form.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.650
Aquarion.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:42.810
The moment I first laid eyes upon it,

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:48.500
my still heart began to beat once more in a powerful <i>staccato</i>.

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.000
That is...

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.000
the melody of my soul.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.060
Damn you, Machine Angel!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.840
I'll get rid of you once and for all!

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:02.760
Amata. Zessica.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.470
To live is to engrave your life.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:09.470
To make the melody of your life resonate with the world!

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:14.250
Help me! Help me play out the melody of my life!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.480
You got it!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.480
If you're going to beat him, I'm with you!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:25.480
Now let us play out our souls as an <i>arpeggio</i>!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:33.620
Damn it!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.500
Amata's Element power is skyrocketing!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.380
Add Zessica's force...

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.890
And when you combine those two with Shrade's power...

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.660
Set the moon in the sky with <i>vibrato</i>,

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.390
and the moon on the water in <i>allegro vivace</i>.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.810
What are you talking about?

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:57.320
Then, I will play the moon within us in the <i>agitato</i> of life!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.440
Moonlight Requiem!

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:06.490
What?

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.180
Did he win?

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.190
I'm not done...

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.230
I'm not done fighting yet!

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:43.650
Sorry. I'm taking back the Mithra Gnis.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.020
Stop messing up our reconnaissance.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.660
You're just making my job harder.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:51.660
Damn you, Jin...

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.340
He's getting away!

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:00.630
Shrade, let's go after him!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.130
Shrade?

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:05.550
Wait, Shrade is...

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:09.940
Shrade! Are you okay?

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:12.200
Shrade!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.630
Mikono?

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:21.880
What's the matter, Mikono?

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.080
I don't know.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.860
I don't know, but...

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:31.560
It hurts that I don't know.

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:14.890
I heard that the Academy is haunted by the ghost of a missing Element.

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:17.510
You'll be so scared that you can't even take a leak at night!

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:21.020
I'll dig a hole out, just in case.

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:25.020
Next time on Aquarion Evol: The Midnight Girl.
